<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n59811" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρεμ-αστήρ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῆρος</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>suspender</i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ κρεμαστῆρες</span>
			<i>the muscle by which the testicles are suspended</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				4.635
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				18(2).998
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				2.173
			</span></i>; 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρχεις</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLips.</u>
				42.19
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv A. D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hippiatr.</u>
				30
			</span></i>; but, <i>vasa deferentia</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
				<u>Onom.</u>
				197
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Sat.Gon.</u>
				10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Paul.Aeg.
				6.61
			</span></i>; a supposed <i>muscle suspending the ovaries</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>stalk</i> by which a grape-cluster hangs, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gp.</u>
				5.2.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				5.17.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταρσός</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1625.14
			</span></i>.</div>
